        "nobel_worthiness": "The Aharonov-Bohm effect and geometric phase revealed that global phase structure has directly observable physical consequences.",
        "attribution": "Aharonov is central to the electromagnetic-potential effect, and Berry identified the broadly applicable adiabatic geometric phase.",
        "maturity": "Both ideas have long-standing, extensive experimental confirmation and influence across quantum physics.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "These are related but historically distinct discoveries, so their unity as one prize citation needs careful justification."
        ]
      }
    },
